@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Scan QR Code

actor "Mahasiswa" as Mahasiswa
participant "Frontend" as App
participant "Scanner QR" as Scanner
participant "Backend" as System
database "Database" as DB

Mahasiswa -> App : Membuka menu scan presensi
App -> Scanner : Aktifkan kamera scanner

Mahasiswa -> Scanner : Scan QR Code
Scanner --> App : Data QR Code

App -> System : Kirim data QR Code

System -> DB : Cek validitas QR Code
DB --> System : Status QR Code

alt QR Code valid dan aktif

    System -> DB : Cek data sesi presensi
    DB --> System : Data sesi ditemukan

    System --> App : Presensi dapat dilanjutkan
    App --> Mahasiswa : Presensi berhasil

else QR Code tidak valid atau expired

    System --> App : Presensi gagal
    App --> Mahasiswa : QR Code tidak valid

end

@enduml